### Phase 17 — list organizations
GET http://localhost:4000/api/admin/users/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Phase 17 — create organization
POST http://localhost:4000/api/admin/users/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "North Clinic Group"
}

### Phase 17 — update organization
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/admin/users/organizations/{{ORGANIZATION_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "North Clinic Group Updated"
}

### Phase 17 — delete organization, blocked when dependencies exist
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/admin/users/organizations/{{ORGANIZATION_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Phase 17 — create patient with organization omitted
POST http://localhost:4000/api/admin/users/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Patient",
  "email": "test.patient.phase17@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Phase 17 — create provider with organization omitted
POST http://localhost:4000/api/admin/users/providers
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Provider",
  "email": "test.provider.phase17@example.com",
  "role": "PROVIDER",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Phase 17 — organization audit logs
GET http://localhost:4000/api/admin/users/audit?resource=organization&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
